To substitute $x=1$ into the expression $f(x-1)$, we follow these steps:
\begin{align*}
f(1-1) &= f(0) \\
&= 3(0)^4 + 5(0)^2 - 9(0) - 2 \\
&= 3(0) + 5(0) - 9(0) - 2 \\
&= -2.
\end{align*}
The sum of the coefficients of the polynomial $g(x)$ is therefore $\boxed{-2}$. warfare
